My name is Justin Haley and I am reaching out to you on behalf of your admissions counselor and the ASU Alumni Association. You and your family are invited to a Sun Devil Send-Off, an annual tradition that welcomes incoming ASU students and their families to the Sun Devil family!

Sponsored by the ASU Alumni Association and coordinated by ASU Family, the Weigels, this Sun Devil Send-Off is a great chance to meet other local students coming to ASU in the fall, ask questions of ASU alumni, and most of all, have fun in a casual environment to celebrate your next step into your lifelong ASU experience.

Date: 8/1/2015
Time: 1:30 PM
Location: A&B Pizza
1017 E. Interstate Avenue
Bismarck, N.D.

Please RSVP by July 30 to Lyn Weigel at lweigel05@gmail.com or 701.426.8148 if you are able to attend. We look forward to meeting you!